{"data":[{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1943600316542267781","created_at":"2025-07-11T09:16:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1943600316542267781"],"id":"1943600316542267781","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4938,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"自慰入眠法对我没有用，反而越弄越精神，晚上睡不着，这个毛病已经持续好几年了，不是说睡前自慰一下就能好的。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1943600316542267781"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1943566584611766559","created_at":"2025-07-11T07:02:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1943566584611766559"],"id":"1943566584611766559","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":11814,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"住校一点也不开心，开始怀念我的九号电动车了，桑心～好想你 https://t.co/h9RSekXrSC","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1943566584611766559"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1943502083157627099","created_at":"2025-07-11T02:46:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1943502083157627099"],"id":"1943502083157627099","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5274,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"牛逼！红大爷事件已经在我们班传开了，说是一个八十岁大爷带着假发装大妈诱骗肌肉猛男doi，每个都是高质量，每个都是我梦寐以求的那种，真羡慕～","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1943502083157627099"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1943339603722723612","created_at":"2025-07-10T16:00:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1943339603722723612"],"id":"1943339603722723612","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5578,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"睡不着根本睡不着，宿舍太热了真好奇舍友是怎么睡着的，我感觉像是在汗蒸，算了，脱光睡好了。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1943339603722723612"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1943301257764180400","created_at":"2025-07-10T13:28:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1943301257764180400"],"id":"1943301257764180400","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5327,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"真不是我说学校菜品越来越差了，真不把我们当人，还卖那么贵，我要绝食了！生小气","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1943301257764180400"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1943287059155959969","created_at":"2025-07-10T12:31:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1943287059155959969"],"id":"1943287059155959969","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5269,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"在不让我自慰我要吃小孩了，住校真的好难受都没有机会自慰，已经憋好久了，今晚说什么也要偷偷舒服一下子","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1943287059155959969"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1943252149640606148","created_at":"2025-07-10T10:13:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1943252149640606148"],"id":"1943252149640606148","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10488,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"可算是让我找到充电的地方了，就是有点冒险，你们猜猜这是教室的什么位置? https://t.co/O7MNkrB9e8","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1943252149640606148"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1943191458699501666","created_at":"2025-07-10T06:12:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1943191458699501666"],"id":"1943191458699501666","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5221,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"后悔住校了，昨晚睡不着尝试自慰入眠法拿手机找素材玩的没电了，只有5%了马上就关机了，这可怎么办，你们住校一般都怎么充电？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1943191458699501666"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"1943150274970804682","created_at":"2025-07-10T03:28:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1943150274970804682"],"id":"1943150274970804682","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":66370,"like_count":50,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5